  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEGASE CSP Programme 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The majority of the European Union&#x2019;s assistance
to the Palestinian Authority (PA) is channelled
through the PEGASE Direct Financial Support
(DFS) mechanism. PEGASE DFS was launched in
2008 to support the PA&#x2019;s national reform
agenda and provides budget support for the PA
recurrent expenditure and long-term
sustainable development. The predictable and
regular funding provided by PEGASE DFS also
advances the two-State solution by maintaining
the fiscal viability of the PA and by sustaining
the basic living conditions of the Palestinian
people.</narrative>
  </description>
